                        "entry_id": "57686b8b-9412-3f54-819b-f506f9a239e0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To make (an often-serious topic) humorous."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare",
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5f8c040a-35dc-4361-b2f8-4b31b1806a6f",
                                "sense_id": "8c9ef50b-88e5-3498-93d6-47c3bb4b716c",
                                "text": "There are hundreds of terms for masturbation in men such as \"spanking the monkey\" or \"charming the snake,\" which serve to humorize but also to avoid directly discussing the topic."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "096580a4-b36c-447f-a016-eb555487c5ec",
                                "sense_id": "8c9ef50b-88e5-3498-93d6-47c3bb4b716c",
                                "text": "[…] that were invented by the servicemen and women to undercut, satirize, humorize, and ironize their bleak situation, and to \"evoke the cant of horse-age military supply.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f5f67e48-0ca8-4451-a30f-6ae593323c2f",
                                "sense_id": "8c9ef50b-88e5-3498-93d6-47c3bb4b716c",
                                "text": "That is, in both subtle and blatant ways, utterances report, assert, confirm, claim, doubt, deny, imply, suggest, hint, request, command, forbid, humorize, belittle, pronounce, decree, and so on."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7e42a25b-45bb-4273-bb07-b1c073cb754e",
                                "sense_id": "8c9ef50b-88e5-3498-93d6-47c3bb4b716c",
                                "text": "[…] to my family and friends who will understand my candor, my sarcastic licks, intensity in openness and my own unique way to “humorize” life's experiences."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f936f71-648b-4e59-9e6b-150e4b4ae1ce",
                                "sense_id": "8c9ef50b-88e5-3498-93d6-47c3bb4b716c",
                                "text": "I was able to humorize the situation and make it not sound so serious to her."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
